  "text": "24-Hour Emergency Vet | BluePearl Pet Hospital | Fort Myers, FL\nSkip to the content\nJoin the BluePearl Family!\nWe're hiring.\nFind a Hospital\nSearch the site\nSearch\nSearch the site\nSearch\nResources for Pet Owners\nWhy BluePearl\nIntake Form\nPay with CareCredit\nPet Care Articles and Videos\nStories from the Heart\nResources for Veterinarians\nWhy Refer to BluePearl\nReferral Portal & Medical Records\nOrder BluePearl Materials\nMedical Library for DVMs\nAbout Us\nWho We Are\nOur Areas of Expertise\nNewsroom\nContact Us\nCareers\nFind a Hospital\nHome\nHospitals\nBluePearl Pet Hospital Fort Myers, FL\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nFort Myers, FL\nSpecialty and 24/7 Emergency\n239.947.0588\n9500 Marketplace Rd.\nFort Myers, FL 33912\n[email protected]\nEmergency:\n24/7\nSpecialty:\nBy appointment\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nBluePearl in Fort Myers – serving southwest Florida 24/7.\nWe are a 24-hour emergency vet and specialty animal hospital located in Fort Myers and serve pets and their families in Southwest Florida communities, including Fort Myers, Fort Myers Beach, Cape Coral, Sanibel, Captiva, Marco Island, Immokalee, Venice, Port Charlotte, North Port, Alva, Lehigh Acres, Estero, Bonita Springs, Punta Gorda and more.\nOur reviews.\nOur services.\nWhen your pet needs emergency care, seconds count. Our emergency animal hospital is ready to provide expert care 24/7 in case of a pet emergency. If your pet requires a veterinary specialist, we are ready for that too. Our experienced team of veterinarians, vet technicians and support staff work closely together to provide the comprehensive, compassionate care your pet needs and deserves.\n24/7 emergency veterinary services\nIn an emergency, call ahead and let us know you’re coming. No appointment is necessary. We accept pet emergencies 24 hours a day, 7 days a week and all year round, including holidays. We are also open after hours when your primary vet may not be.\nLearn more about your emergency visit\n.\nSpecialty care\nOur veterinary specialists work directly with your primary care vet to understand your pet’s condition and develop the appropriate treatment plan. Visits to our specialists are usually by referral from your primary care vet and by appointment.\nLearn more about veterinary specialists\n.\nSee Specialties and Services\nOur\nveterinarians.\nCaring for your pets is our passion. Meet our team of emergency and specialty veterinarians here to help you and your pet.\nSee Veterinarians\nAbout BluePearl Pet Hospital Fort Myers.\nOur BluePearl pet hospital in Fort Myers, formerly known as Specialized Veterinary Services, offers the most advanced and comprehensive specialty veterinary care for pets in Southwest Florida.\nIn our 18,000 square-foot facility, we have a CT scanner and MRI, and other state-of-the-art diagnostic equipment. We also offer physical rehabilitation, including underwater treadmill therapy and therapeutic ultrasound. We are fully equipped as a 24-hour pet hospital and have multiple surgery suites. A veterinary surgeon is on-call around the clock.\nPet owners.\nAt BluePearl Pet Hospitals, providing our customers with remarkable service is a top priority. We’re committed to making your veterinary visit as smooth as possible.\nHave questions prior to your visit? We’re happy to help. Contact our hospital team at\n239.947.0588\nor\n[email protected]\n.\nCurrent location.\n239.947.0588\n239.947.0598\n9500 Marketplace Rd.\nFort Myers,\nFL                                    33912\n[email protected]\nOther hospitals.\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nSarasota, FL\n7414 South Tamiami Trail\nSarasota, FL 34231\n941.923.7260\n65.32 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nBrandon, FL\n607 Lumsden Professional Ct.\nBrandon, FL 33511\n813.571.3303\n99.74 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nFort Lauderdale, FL\n3217 NW 10th Terr.\nFt. Lauderdale, FL 33309\n954.641.1100\n104.79 miles\nGet In Touch\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\n2950 Busch Lake Blvd.\nTampa\n, FL\n33614\nContact Us\nFind a Hospital Near Me\nCareers at BluePearl\nBluePearl™ Cares\nWeb Accessibility\nYour Privacy Choices\nStay Connected\nHere for pets.\nWhen it matters most.\nStay connected with BluePearl for expert advice, helpful tips and trusted information to support you and your pet - delivered straight to your inbox.\nSign Up\ncookies notice\nprivacy policy\nlegal\nad choices\nterms & conditions\naccessibility\ncontact us\na\nbrand\n© 2026 BluePearl Holdings LLC. All rights reserved.\nCookie Settings",
